Package: lcos-settings
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xfconf, desktop-file-utils, gtk-update-icon-cache, adwaita-icon-theme-legacy
Description: LCOS Command Center, unified settings for LCOS
 LCOS Command Center is a GTK 3 settings window for the Lunduke Computer
 Operating System. It covers display, desktop background, appearance,
 desktop, appearance, window manager, notifications, removable media,
 accessibility, power, keyboard, mouse, sound, and default software, using
 the same xfconf, RandR, UPower, and PulseAudio backing stores as the XFCE
 4.20 tools shipped with LCOS. The section list uses the Adwaita Legacy
 icons.
